flowchart LR
  Dev[Developer changes] --> FEInstall[Install frontend dependencies]
  Dev --> BEInstall[Install backend dependencies]
  FEInstall --> FBuild[npm run build: Vite]
  BEInstall --> BStart[node index.js]
  FBuild --> VercelSPA[frontend Vercel SPA rewrite config]
  BStart --> VercelAPI[root Vercel Node builder config]
  VercelAPI --> Env[Deployment environment variables]
  Env --> Mongo[(MongoDB)]
  Env --> Redis[(Redis optional/fallback)]
  Env --> Third[GitHub / Cloudinary / SMTP optional]
  FBuild -. no CI workflow found .-> Manual[Manual/host-managed build path]
  BStart -. Socket.IO needs persistent connection support .-> Runtime[Hosting runtime capability must be verified]
